    benefits: [{"title":"Greater Independence","body":"Care is built around the activities that matter most to you, such as self-care, household tasks, work and leisure."},{"title":"Practical, Goal-Driven Care","body":"Goals are written in terms of real activities, not just test scores."},{"title":"Tailored Treatment","body":"Because every person's goals differ, therapy is tailored rather than one-size-fits-all."},{"title":"Coordinated Team","body":"Our team also includes speech therapy, psychiatry and case management, so care can be coordinated when needs overlap."}],
